@startuml data-flow
!include _theme.puml
' Level-one discovery data flow. Arrows name data, not triggers or control states.
rectangle "Candidate" as Person
rectangle "Public job boards" as Board
usecase "Parse resume" as Parse
usecase "Refresh corpus" as Refresh
database "Private profile" as Private
database "Shared listings" as Shared
usecase "Score and rank" as Score
database "Private matches" as Matches

Person -down-> Parse : upload
Board -down-> Refresh : job postings
Parse -down-> Private : profile facts
Refresh -down-> Shared : normalized jobs
Private -down-> Score : candidate facts
Shared -down-> Score : job features
Score -right-> Matches : top scores\nand reasons
Person -[hidden]right-> Board
@enduml
